| File | What changed |
|------|-------------|
| `client/src/api/socket.js` | **New file** – `SocketManager` class encapsulates all socket.io lifecycle: `connect`, `disconnect`, `emit`, `on`, `off`. Persists named listeners across reconnects. |
| `client/src/api/api.js` | Added `initSocket()`, `disconnectSocket()` and a `socket` getter. Removed the `socket.io-client` import (now lives in `socket.js`). The `sid` field is updated via the `onConnect` callback. |
| `client/src/store/session.js` | Removed the direct `socket.io-client` import and all raw socket mutation state. `connect()` now calls `API.initSocket(...)`, `login()` calls `API.socket.emit(...)`, and `emit()` delegates to `API.socket.emit(...)`. The `socket` getter exposes `API.socket` for any component that needs it. |
